---
title: "The Zero Fog Workshop"
permalink: /workshop/room/
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{# The session room. Token-gated: everything on this page is drawn from what wr-room.js returns
   for the token in the URL, and nothing - including the video address - is rendered without one.

   Deliberately at /workshop/room/ rather than replacing /workshop/. The existing /workshop/ page
   is the walkthrough copy that /confirmation/ still links to, and it keeps working until the
   database is live and this room has been tested end to end. Swapping them later is one line of
   frontmatter, not a rewrite.

   Copy rule, CEO 2026-08-11: workshop and session. Never "webinar", never "training". #}

{% block head_extras %}
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
{% endblock %}

{% block page_css %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/css/pages/replay-3.css' | v }}">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/css/pages/workshop-room.css' | v }}">
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<a href="/" class="brand">The Zero Fog</a>
<button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" onclick="toggleTheme()">Light</button>

<div class="replay room" id="room">

  <h1>The 4-Week Process That Cleared My Brain Fog And Got My Sharp Hours Back</h1>

  <p class="room-status" id="roomStatus">Opening your session…</p>

  <p class="room-countdown" id="roomCountdown" hidden></p>

  <div class="room-expiry-bar" id="roomExpiryBar" hidden>
    <span class="room-expiry-label">This replay closes in</span>
    <span class="room-expiry-nums" id="roomExpiry">--:--:--</span>
  </div>

  <p class="room-notice" id="roomNotice" hidden></p>

  <div class="room-stage" id="roomStage" hidden>
    <div class="video-wrapper">
      {# The caption track is added by JS from the config, not hardcoded here - the master
         carries its captions as an embedded mov_text track, which no browser renders, so they
         are served as a WebVTT sidecar instead. #}
      {# disablePictureInPicture: the blur is a CSS filter on this element, and Picture-in-Picture
         paints the decoded frames in an OS window where page CSS does not reach. Two clicks in
         Chrome's own context menu and the whole session plays unblurred, un-joined - watched in
         full by someone the room then files as a no-show. controlsList keeps the same menu from
         offering the master as a download once the replay turns controls on. #}
      <video id="roomVideo" playsinline preload="metadata"
             disablePictureInPicture controlsList="nodownload noremoteplayback"></video>
      <button type="button" class="room-join" id="roomJoin" hidden>Join the session</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="room-handouts" id="roomHandouts" hidden></div>

  <div class="replay-cta room-offer" id="roomOffer" hidden>
    <h2 id="roomOfferHeadline"></h2>
    <p>The founding member price won't last. Lock in $67 before it goes back to $167.</p>
    <p class="price">$67</p>
    <p class="price-sub">One-time payment. Lifetime access. 30-day guarantee.</p>
    <a href="/sales#enroll" class="cta-btn" id="roomOfferBtn">Get The Protocol</a>
  </div>

  <form class="room-question" id="roomQuestionForm">
    <label for="roomQuestion">Have a question? Send it to Kirill.</label>
    <textarea id="roomQuestion" rows="2" placeholder="Type your question…"></textarea>
    <button type="submit" class="room-question-btn">Send</button>
    <p class="room-question-note" id="roomQuestionNote"></p>
  </form>

  <p class="room-sticky" id="roomSticky" hidden></p>

  <p class="disclaimer">This is an educational program, not medical treatment. Results vary.</p>

</div>

{% endblock %}

{% block page_scripts %}
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/pages/workshop-room.js' | v }}" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
